  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Economics"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The objective of the Minor is to offer students a coherent group of courses in the discipline of Economics. It will enable students from different professional programs to pursue Economics as a related area of study, and it will give both greater breadth and depth to the program of studies of those who choose it. The Minor will provide formal recognition to those students who complete its requirements."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: Department of Economics"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Exclusions: This minor is not available to students in the following programs:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Business Management - Economics and Management Science Major , regular and co-op.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Business Management - Economics and Management Science Major",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/trsm/business_mgt/economics_management_science_major/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Economics and Finance",
